{%- comment -%}
  "Your journey to smooth, radiant skin" section (copy of the evorabody.com section): a big picture on one side, and on the other an italic-ending title, a short line and a vertical timeline of 4 steps (small icon, a "Day 1" style badge, a step title and a short text).
  Desktop (wider than 1023px) = picture left, timeline right, vertically centred. Phone and tablet = picture first, timeline underneath.
  No slider app or library, so it loads fast.
  WHERE: best as its own full-width section: Online Store > Themes > Customize > Product page > Add section > Custom Liquid, drag it where you want it, paste this in.
  If you paste it inside a narrow column instead, set mb_bleed to false.
  EDIT YOUR CONTENT BELOW. Do not use a straight apostrophe (') in the text, use &#39; instead. For an ampersand use &amp;.
  mb_title_1 = the first part of the title. mb_title_2 = the last part, shown in italics. Leave mb_title_2 empty for a plain title.
  mb_subtitle = the line under the title (leave empty to hide it).
  mb_img = the big picture (a link to a picture). mb_img_alt = its description for screen readers (empty is fine for a decorative picture).
  mb_steps = your steps, separated by @@ and each one written as   ICON LINK ||| BADGE ||| STEP TITLE ||| TEXT
  (the icon is a small square picture. With no icon link that step just has no icon.)
  THE PICTURES BELOW ARE LINKED FROM evorabody.com SO YOU CAN SEE THE SECTION WORKING. For a live store, save the big picture and each icon, upload them in Shopify admin > Content > Files, then paste your own links in place. That keeps the section working if the original files ever change.
  IMPORTANT: the timeline is a promise to your customers. Only keep the results and the times that your product and your own testing really support.
  mb_bg = section colour. mb_color_title = title colour. mb_color_text = every other text colour.
  mb_color_accent = the dots and the badge colour. mb_color_badge_text = the writing on the badge.
  mb_color_line = the line joining the dots. As you scroll down the page this line fills in from each dot towards the next one, and every dot lights up when the line reaches it.
  mb_color_track = the faint line that sits underneath while it is still empty (set it to transparent to have no line at all until it draws in).
  mb_animate = true for the scroll animation, false for a plain finished line. mb_reach = how far down the screen the line reaches, as a percentage of the screen height (60 = a little below the middle, bigger = it draws sooner).
  People who set their phone or computer to reduce motion always see the plain finished line.
  mb_radius = how round the big picture corners are. mb_pad_d / mb_pad_m = space above and below the content on desktop / phone.
  mb_bleed = true stretches the section edge to edge across the screen. mb_top / mb_bottom = space above and below the block.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mb_title_1 = 'Your Journey To Smooth,' -%}
{%- assign mb_title_2 = 'Radiant Skin' -%}
{%- assign mb_subtitle = 'Reclaim your confidence and wear what you love again.' -%}
{%- assign mb_img = 'https://evorabody.com/cdn/shop/files/EBO-Model-2_9e537b39-d768-4a88-819c-04cda12398e0.png?v=1788333163' -%}
{%- assign mb_img_alt = '' -%}
{%- capture mb_steps -%}
